{"reviewId": "46576874_88J4a7kCV", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "与通常理解的顶和底不同，衰退是增速放缓，仍属于上升期。回升是下降趋势放缓，仍属于下降期。", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "如果按照繁荣、衰退、萧条、回升四个阶段来划分康波，康波的顶指的是衰退期的结束，也就是说，繁荣和衰退是康波的上升期。而康波的谷指的是回升的结束，也就是说，萧条和回升是康波的下降期。", "range": "2032-2121", "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "46576874_88J4a7kCV", "userVid": 46576874, "topics": [], "createTime": 1777453586, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 46576874, "name": "Jellyjelly", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0014-LsTlqx_rbatlaGoAL8hco10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "Jellyjelly", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 98, "likes": [{"userVid": 411234285, "name": "Max", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/iauG3otowXkDExVo0F41VHoKZabUHmo41H7sbmQAliaAQJediccCHmwQn9jGt8DkoVUId6od71icD5jzsOuKYfGyXmGLfLfmzHT44CYOkIMEcUQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M12-2-3-I-0-0-0", "desc": "世界读书日", "title": "世界读书日", "levelIndex": 0}}], "commentsCount": 4, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "学到了", "reviewId": "46576874_88J4a7kCV", "commentId": "46576874_88J4a7kCV_c432441862_8cXIkrMYS", "userVid": 432441862, "createTime": 1792372046, "author": {"use